# .gitignore for COGME Project

# OS and Editor Specific
**/.DS_Store
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/.ipynb_checkpoints
**/.vscode/
**/Thumbs.db

# Build and Output
**/dist/
**/build/
**/tmp/
**/coverage/
**/*.tar.gz
**/*.zip

# Dependency Management
**/node_modules/
**/yarn.lock
**/package-lock.json
**/pnpm-lock.yaml

# IDE and Editor Config
**/.idea/
**/.project
**/.settings/
**/.classpath

# Security and Sensitive Data
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.cer
**/*.jks
**/*.truststore
**/credentials.json

# Temporary and Log Files
**/*.log
**/*.tmp
**/*.swp
**/*.bak

# Documentation Exclusions
**/docs/intermediate/
**/docs/legacy/

# Note: exclui mecanismos internos e artefatos sensíveis conforme governança do projeto. A documentação pública permanece em /docs e /README.md.

# --- Ambiente Python e caches (normalização ratificada 2026-10-30) ---
**/venv/
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.benchmarks/

# restaurado 2026-10-26 (VIO-012): pesos locais fora do repo
# ancorado em 2026-10-30: 'models/' sem âncora mascarava src/backend/models/ (pacote Python)
/models/
*.gguf

# --- Higiene anti-bloat (pasta-raiz) — decisão CCB-LOG-2026-10-30-A01 ---
argparse
lst.txt
*.tmp.md
.~*.docx
.obsidian/

# Artefatos de cobertura e tipagem
.coverage
.mypy_cache/

# OpenCode skills (local tooling)
.opencode/skills/

# OpenCode plugins and scripts (local tooling)
.opencode/plugins/
.opencode/scripts/

# OpenCode commands, core, hooks e config (framework, não código COGME)
# Agentes COGME nativos (.opencode/agents/agent-*.md) permanecem versionados.
.opencode/commands/
.opencode/gsd-core/
.opencode/hooks/
.opencode/opencode.jsonc
.opencode/.gsd-profile
.opencode/settings.json

# Agentes framework GSD (não são agentes COGME nativos)
.opencode/agents/gsd-*.md
.opencode/agents/archive/
.opencode/gsd-file-manifest.json
.opencode/gsd-install-state.json
.opencode/gsd-migration-journal/

# --- Saneamento 2026-11-05: remoção de bloat e tooling local ---
# Build Python
*.egg-info/
*.egg-link

# Lockfile (projeto usa requirements.txt)
uv.lock

# Tarefas órfavas raiz
task-ta-*.json

# Locks transitórios de agente
.ai/agents/locks/
